{"Title":"An Act Williamstown alcoholic beverage license","BillNumber":"H4073","DocketNumber":"HD4463","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"J_B1","Name":"John Barrett, III","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/J_B1","ResponseDate":"2023-07-13T16:13:15.853"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"J_B1","Name":"John Barrett, III","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/J_B1","ResponseDate":"2023-07-13T16:13:15.8533333"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H4073/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Barrett of North Adams, a petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 4073) of John Barrett, III (by vote of the town) that the town of Williamstown be authorized to grant an additional license for the sale of all alcoholic beverages to be drunk off the premises in said town.  Consumer Protection and Professional Licensure.  [Local Approval Received.]","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Notwithstanding section 17 of chapter 138 of the General Laws, or any other general or special law to the contrary, the Town of Williamstown may be authorized to allow for an additional alcoholic beverage license for the sale of all alcoholic beverages to be drunk off the premises and grant such license to Asnit LLC, dba Gold Leaf Shop located at 240B Main Street, or take any other action related thereto. \r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J17","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J17"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}